msgid "Best ERP/MRP/MES system I've ever seen in a 22-year career across defense and automotive. Native Onshape integration means we synchronize all our data without extra PLM connectors — good UX, modern integrations, open source, open API and MCP, cloud or on-prem. We run our whole electric-vehicle engineering and manufacturing business on Carbon, and I couldn't imagine going back to a legacy system."
